      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Five private agreement choices with native radio semantics.",
      "html": "<fieldset class=\"ds-rating\"><legend>The person speaking knows exactly what they are talking about</legend><div><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"example-rating\" value=\"1\"><span>1</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"example-rating\" value=\"2\"><span>2</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"example-rating\" value=\"3\"><span>3</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"example-rating\" value=\"4\"><span>4</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"example-rating\" value=\"5\"><span>5</span></label></div><p><span>Strongly disagree</span><span>Strongly agree</span></p></fieldset>",
